---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="About The Elite Spa Centre in Kalyani Nagar"
  description="Learn about The Elite Spa Centre, a Kalyani Nagar, Pune spa offering a menu of massage, couples, body-care and wellness experiences for adults."
>
  <section class="page">
    <span class="eyebrow-light">A CALMER KIND OF LUXURY</span>
    <h1>Wellness, with <i>intention.</i></h1>
    <p>A welcoming spa destination in Kalyani Nagar for thoughtful massage, body care and wellness experiences.</p>
  </section>
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="about-lead">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">YOUR PAUSE IN PUNE</span>
        <h2>A moment that starts with <i>listening.</i></h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="lead">The Elite Spa Centre brings together a broad menu of massage, couples rituals, body-care and wellness enquiries in one place. Our website is designed to help you explore the options before speaking with the team.</p>
        <p>Every guest has their own comfort preferences. When you enquire, share the type of experience you are considering, the pressure you prefer, any areas to avoid and any relevant allergies or sensitivities.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="about-values">
      <article><span>01</span><h3>Comfort comes first</h3><p>Discuss your preferences and comfort boundaries with the team before a session. You can ask questions before deciding whether a treatment feels right for you.</p></article>
      <article><span>02</span><h3>Clear communication</h3><p>Appointment requests are handled through WhatsApp. The team confirms the available time and final price directly; an online enquiry is not a reservation.</p></article>
      <article><span>03</span><h3>Professional wellness</h3><p>Services are presented as professional, non-sexual wellness experiences for adults, with consent, appropriate draping and clear professional boundaries.</p></article>
    </section>
    <section class="about-note">
      <h2>Explore at your <i>own pace.</i></h2>
      <p>Browse the treatment menu, read the wellness journal or contact the team with questions about suitability, products and appointment availability. Wellness treatments are not a substitute for medical assessment or care.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn" href="/services/">Explore treatments ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">CONTACT THE CENTRE ↗</a></div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
